            <ArticleTitle>Munchausen syndrome: case reports and literature overview.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-43</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Munchausen syndrome is a subset of factitious disorders with a number of distinguishing characteristics. This article presents three case reports and brief discussions to facilitate recognition. Management techniques are also presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
